<title>UK: Gen Acc Q1 helped by fall in weather losses.</title>
<headline>Gen Acc Q1 helped by fall in weather losses.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurance composite General Accident Plc on Tuesday reported a record first quarter, helped by a fall in weather costs in the first three months of the year.</p>
<p>Operating profits for the period more than doubled to 114 million pounds ($184.8 million), compared with 55 million pounds last year.</p>
